who don't have the means

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:08.220
to maybe be buried, to
have a gravestone at all

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:09.053
can be buried.

00:04:09.053 --> 00:04:11.470
And I don't know exactly
how that process works

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:12.570
but I just know that they're,

00:04:12.570 --> 00:04:14.060
yeah there's some famous people

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:15.540
and it's been around for a long time

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:17.081
but there's also some people

00:04:17.081 --> 00:04:19.780
who don't have the means
for that kind of burial.

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:23.670
Who get these really awesome grave plots.

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:25.450
And the thing that we noticed

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:28.450
as we parked the car and
we took the scenic route

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:30.580
walking through these gravestones

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:33.600
in order to get the theater location,

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:35.850
well the concert location.
The lawn.

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:36.683
The lawn.

00:04:37.567 --> 00:04:38.573
Pretty much all of them,

00:04:38.573 --> 00:04:42.890
I wanna say at least
90% of the gravestones

00:04:42.890 --> 00:04:47.374
